    expect: {
        components: {
            "forgeweave:modifiers": [
                {
                    id: "forgeweave:reinforced",
                    level: 2
                }
            ],
            "forgeweave:tool_materials": {
                binding: "forgeweave:supremium",
                handle: "forgeweave:supremium",
                head: "forgeweave:supremium"
            },
            "forgeweave:tool_stats": {
                attack_damage: 6.4f,
                durability: 960,
                mining_speed: 8.6f
            },
            "forgeweave:traits": [],
            "minecraft:custom_data": {
                "mysticalagriculture:equipped_augments": [
                    {
                        id: "mysticalagriculture:mining_aoe_1",
                        slot: 0
                    }
                ]
            },
            "minecraft:damage": 0,
            "minecraft:max_damage": 960
        },
        id: "forgeweave:pickaxe"
    },
    nbt: {
        components: {
            "forgeweave:modifiers": [
                {
                    id: "forgeweave:reinforced",
                    level: 2
                }
            ],
            "forgeweave:tool_materials": {
                binding: "forgeweave:supremium",
                handle: "forgeweave:supremium",
                head: "forgeweave:supremium"
            },
            "forgeweave:tool_stats": {
                attack_damage: 6.4f,
                durability: 960,
                mining_speed: 8.6f
            },
            "forgeweave:traits": [],
            "minecraft:custom_data": {
                "mysticalagriculture:equipped_augments": [
                    {
                        id: "mysticalagriculture:mining_aoe_1",
                        slot: 0
                    }
                ]
            },
            "minecraft:damage": 0,
            "minecraft:max_damage": 960
        },
        count: 1,
        id: "forgeweave:pickaxe"
    },
    what: "#999 (D-M8-20): an all-supremium pickaxe carrying a Forgeweave modifier and a Mystical Agriculture augment at the same time, decoding without losing either. The augment rides in minecraft:custom_data rather than on the real mysticalagriculture:equipped_augments component, for the reason m8_socketed.snbt gives for using minecraft:diamond instead of an Apotheosis gem: no unit-test registry holds a Mystical Agriculture component type, and an unregistered component id fails the decode outright rather than round-tripping. The inner key and the (id, slot) pair are Mystical Agriculture's own -- AugmentComponent is a record of exactly those two fields, and the list lives under mysticalagriculture:equipped_augments -- so the shape this pins is the real one even though the outer component is a stand-in. What matters here is that Forgeweave's own decode does not eat a foreign component sitting beside its own: the item class changing across a config flip is exactly the shape that loses components when it goes wrong, which is why this fixture is in this PR rather than deferred to #975. Forgeweave never writes or migrates the augment list -- that is Mystical Agriculture's data, the rule JC-D set for Apotheosis affixes."
}
